  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0 (additive): interpolated read API - SelectInterpolated<T>/SelectInterpolated (DataTable)/SelectStreamInterpolatedAsync<T> (+ async), completing the FormattableString surface for queries. 2.1.0 (additive): transactions/unit-of-work (BeginTransaction/BeginTransactionAsync -> ISqlServerUnitOfWork); stored procedures (ExecuteProcedure/QueryProcedure/ExecuteProcedureScalar); ExecuteScalar<T>; InsertModel now writes back the generated [Identity] value; Count/Exists; attribute-resolved GetModelByKey/DeleteByKey; SelectPaged (OFFSET/FETCH); batch ExecuteInterpolated. Performance: per-column compiled coercion delegates, await using async disposal, explicit string/Guid/bool parameter typing, streamed bulk insert (no DataTable) + IEnumerable overload. Note: ISqlServerHelper gained members (source-breaking for custom implementers only).",
